			"notes": "## [1.4.4] - 2026-10-18\n\n### Security\n- Fixed ReDoS-prone regular expressions in version and paste response parsing on Paper and Fabric\n- Replaced deprecated Bukkit APIs flagged by code scanning (`getDescription`, `getDisplayName`, `sendTitle`, `Sound.valueOf`, `TextComponent.fromLegacyText`, `Spigot.sendMessage`, `World.get/setGameRuleValue`) with Adventure and PluginMeta replacements\n- Removed dead code and made the Fabric `TaskScheduler.Task` holder static\n- Null-hardened Fabric `/onlysleep world` and `/onlysleep gamemode` command handlers\n\n### Fixed\n- Fixed an inverted creative-mode check in Fabric `SleepCounts` that miscounted required sleepers\n- Fixed double percentage symbol appearing in `/onlysleep status` on Paper\n- Moved diagnostic dump paste uploads off the main server thread to run asynchronously\n- Replaced deprecated `org.bukkit.ChatColor` across Paper with a dedicated `LegacyText` helper to eliminate deprecation warnings while preserving formatting\n- Added support for underscores in raw Fabric configuration paths and improved percentage value parsing\n- Enforced `Locale.ROOT` across commands and configuration keys to prevent locale-specific casing bugs\n\n### Changed\n- Refactored monolithic sleep managers on Paper and Fabric into dedicated lifecycle controllers (`SkipCoordinator`, `GradualSkipController`, `SleepCounts`, `SleepEffects`, `SleepGamerules`)\n- Split command handlers into dedicated action, dump, and config editor classes\n- Unified bed-leave and disconnect handling into a shared departure path on both platforms\n- Update checks now point at https://demonz.org/projects/onlysleep alongside Modrinth\n- Halloween countdown display is now colourised for both console and in-game chat"
		},
